flowchart TD
  U[Tenant users] --> G[API gateway]
  G --> I[Identity + membership]
  G --> ING[Ingestion workers]
  ING --> O[(Object store)]
  ING --> DB[(PostgreSQL + RLS)]
  ING --> V[(Vector index)]
  G --> R[RAG query service]
  R --> V
  R --> M[Model gateway]
  R --> A[Agent orchestrator]
  A --> P[Tool policy + approval]
  P --> T[MCP tools]
  A --> S[A2A specialists]
  Q[Queue + workers] --> ING
  Q --> A
  G --> OBS[Audit + observability]
  R --> OBS
  A --> OBS
  CI[CI/CD + artifact registry] --> DEP[Deployment controller]
  DEP --> G
  X[Untrusted retrieved content / model output] -. no authority .-> P
